/*
  WeekOverWeekSummary.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0078 · WeekOverWeekSummary (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  WeekOverWeekSummary resolves (table "WeekOverWeekSummary") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys + English defaults extracted from the web source
  (features/analytics/components/weekly-digest/WeekOverWeekSummary.tsx). The second
  group carries the tile unit suffixes the web passes as literal `unit="…"` props,
  routed through the facade so no English/literal text is hardcoded in Swift. The
  third group is the digest empty-state copy its page owner renders
  (WeeklyDigestPage.tsx). The remaining keys back the native-only chrome
  (freshness / offline / error / refresh + accessibility composition).
*/

